{"id":"ehew595h1p8oxyrh6bre9lxq3","title":"伊朗军方宣布霍尔木兹海峡关闭条件及长期关闭意向","originalTitle":"伊朗军方：若美国不接受伊条件，霍尔木兹海峡将继续关闭","summary":"伊朗军方发言人阿克拉米尼亚于11月16日晚宣布，若美国不接受伊朗设定的条件，霍尔木兹海峡将继续关闭。此外，外国军队在波斯湾和阿曼湾的存在被指威胁地区安全，伊朗军方强调海峡将不会恢复战前状态。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15338972.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T23:06:20.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T23:21:42.158Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T23:21:42.158Z","category":"macro","tags":["政策发布"],"score":88,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"fecc0596-57aa-4791-a296-fbffd0bac213","title":"伊朗表示若美国不接受条件霍尔木兹海峡将继续关闭"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(界面快报)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"fecc0596-57aa-4791-a296-fbffd0bac213","title":"伊朗表示若美国不接受条件霍尔木兹海峡将继续关闭"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"faXDViHvxHi0","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}